OL,3,AAdjusting triple lock to fund social
OL,4,Acare 'is about helping pensioners',
OL,5,ABurnham says, as Tories criticise plan
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrom April 2030 the direct link with
OL,8,Fannual earnings will be dropped - but
OL,9,FBurnham denies scrapping the triple
OL,10,Flock, saying it's an "adjustment" to
OL,11,Fkeep pace with earnings over a "longer
OL,12,Ftimeframe"
OL,14,FThe Conservatives have criticised the
OL,15,Fproposal, with Tory chair Kevin
OL,16,FHollinrake saying it amounts to "taking
OL,17,Fmoney out of the pocket of pensioners
OL,18,Fand using it elsewhere in the system"
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
