OL,3,AAdjusting triple lock to fund social
OL,4,Acare 'is about helping pensioners',
OL,5,ABurnham says, as Tories criticise plan
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurnham also tells the BBC there are
OL,8,F"clearly options to be considered" when
OL,9,Fit comes to the UK rejoining the EU -
OL,10,Fbut the government has to look at
OL,11,F"what's doable"
